    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Data-psalm Conclave",
    "summary": "As the [first battle round](vsdata:core-rule/start-of-battle-round) starts, pick one Benediction of the Omnissiah; it is active for your **CULT MECHANICUS** units until the battle ends:\n\n- **PANEGYRIC PROCESSION**: whenever a **CULT MECHANICUS** model of yours makes a ranged attack at a target within half range, that attack's [AP](vsdata:core-rule/weapons) improves by 1.\n- **CITATION IN SAVAGERY**: whenever a **CULT MECHANICUS** unit of yours is **[selected to fight](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase)** having made its **[Charge move](vsdata:core-rule/charge-move)** this turn, its models' melee weapons get +1 Strength and +1 Attacks for the rest of the phase.",
